<caption><p>Correlation between Multiple Parameters of Angiogenesis Analysis and MVD of Tumors</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjr-9-243-i002"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>Note.-<sup>*</sup><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05</p><p>MVD = microvessel density, BV = blood volume, Q = blood flow, TA = time to arrival, rTA = relative time to arrival, MTT = mean transit time</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Pathological Diagnosis and MVD of Tumors</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjr-9-243-i003"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>Note.-IP = intraductal proliferation, IDC = invasive ductal carcinoma</p><p>MVD = microvessel density, HPF = high power fields</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>